ADAPTER        VERSION     LANGUAGE           SOURCE   DESCRIPTION
debugpy        1.8.22      python             bundled  Python debugger by Microsoft (MIT); needs Python 3.10+
  options: justMyCode=bool (default true), module, python
delve          1.27.2      go                 bundled  Go debugger (MIT); set EYEDBG_DLV if dlv isn't on PATH
  options: buildFlags, mode (default debug)
lldb-dap-c     18+         c                  bundled  C debugger using LLVM's lldb-dap (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception); set EYEDBG_LLDB_DAP if not on PATH
lldb-dap-cpp   18+         cpp                bundled  C++ debugger using LLVM's lldb-dap (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception); set EYEDBG_LLDB_DAP if not on PATH
lldb-dap-rust  18+         rust               bundled  Rust debugger using LLVM's lldb-dap (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception); set EYEDBG_LLDB_DAP if not on PATH
netcoredbg     3.2.0-1092  dotnet (built-in)  bundled  .NET debugger by Samsung (MIT)
toydbg         1.0         toy                user     The fake test adapter
  file: <config>/adapters/toy.json
  options: lines=int (default 10)
ignored: <config>/adapters/broken.json: description: is required
